{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/193715-sell-me-on-mummy","id":193715,"title":"Sell me on Mummy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-10T09:43:16-07:00","id":193715,"title":"Sell me on Mummy","content":"I really like the general idea, but before I go out and buy th book can someone spell out the theme of the game? Like when you think of Mummy what kinda stories do you think of and etc? I just want to make sure it's my cup of tea","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T13:49:53-07:00","id":193939,"title":"","content":"My stories almost write themselves, but Ive used flashbacks extensively. History between characters unfolds as time and memory progress. Trusted allies are remembered to be vile traitors or former lovers. Actions taken in the past come back to haunt you. The slow understanding of what mummies really are adds a lovecraftian horror edge. Hell, i ran it for months without even addressing ghosts, amkhata, shuanksen, or even relics. Storylines over the main cultists reincarnations, and how he has interacted with the two mummies over the millenia, have been just so juicy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T17:43:22-07:00","id":194146,"title":"","content":"Mummy is a game about playing a character who's as old as civilization. It's an exploration of old age - what it means, how people deal with it, etc. Mummies are creatures of contradictions. They've seen the birth and death of entire cultures; and yet, they can't remember if they supported the births or brought forth the destructions of nations. When they arise, they have all the power in the world - they can destroy entire cities, if they so choose - but they have so little time to do anything, really. The sand is always running through their fingers, and the irony of a mummy's immortality is that she has to make constant priority calls. The powers of the Arisen are vast and glorious and terrible, but also very specific. The Arisen are old testament gods - pillars of fire, plagues, death curses, parting the red sea, that sort of thing. There is a sadness to their vast power - theirs is a kind of magic that is ageless, but it's also static, can't change, and that the world has largely left behind; like the Arisen themselves. The Arisen rise into the modern world...and find that nothing fundamental has changed, socially speaking. The downtrodden are still exactly that, and the rich still benefit from exploiting everyone else. The details might be different, but to these creatures who have seen millenia pass, the world is functionally the same as in the culture that created them. The Arisen sympathize with those poor and downtrodden - their is an existence of service and slavery that can never, ever end. To be Arisen is glorious. Your flesh is immortal. Your spirit seethes with magical power. You have seen the roots of civilization and whisper in their secret language. When your eyes open, they belong to a divine patron, a lord, a god. You\u2019ve seen the gates of the underworld and know for immutable fact that death is not the end of eternal power. To be Arisen is terrifying. Your body is a falsehood\u2014a simulated corpse made out of congealed necromancy. You attended the deaths of civilizations, and you can\u2019t remember if you held back the barbarians or put a knife in the emperor\u2019s back. Your eyes are hollow, dry pits; your life signs are a lie you can only tell the world while your true power trickles away. You have seen the gods of the Underworld and know for a fact that death is not the end of eternal service and duty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T17:47:24-07:00","id":194150,"title":"","content":"also, read this: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/11948-1001-mummy-story-hooks\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...my-story-hooks</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T21:25:33-07:00","id":197437,"title":"","content":"Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T05:24:02-07:00","id":201026,"title":"","content":"Maybe have a watch of this, it's what made me buy Mummy:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ezqH26CjcAs\" data-code=\"ezqH26CjcAs\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ezqH26CjcAs/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T06:47:14-07:00","id":202068,"title":"","content":"It is a great game, but somewhat unfinished at its current publication schedule. With each supplement released it becomes a great game. Just based on the core no, it leaves alot unanswered (and in this game some questions need answering).<br /> <br /> But Im biased, I love this game and have been running it for 2 years now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","